  </p>

  <h2>10. Beta / founding features</h2>
  <p>
    Features labelled alpha, beta, founding, or experimental are provided as-is
    and may change or end. SLAs, if any, do not apply unless expressly stated.
  </p>

  <h2>11. Warranties &amp; disclaimer</h2>
